{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/extras/99a08527855383ed9f011c7dafa02799.avif?t=1773469469\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/extras/8ce4580789136fefcfa86e9e143a0c73.poster.avif?t=1773469469\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/extras/8ce4580789136fefcfa86e9e143a0c73.webm?t=1773469469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/extras/8ce4580789136fefcfa86e9e143a0c73.mp4?t=1773469469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>Full-Keyboard Rhythm Game</strong> where you perform music across your entire keyboard. Inspired by 1970s-80s cinema, visuals are crafted with VHS aesthetics and montage techniques. Feel the satisfying clack of every keystroke and experience the VHS graphic art that responds to your performance. Each level reveals story fragments through unique interactions, with 42 distinct experiences converging into one complete narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<br>From the Solo Developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I believe that meaningful experiences are the essence of games. That's why I design experimental game experiences that go beyond conventional game mechanics. I layered analog aesthetics, sensory feedback, and visual storytelling to create something that feels both familiar and new. That's how Off the Text came to be.<br>\u3000<br><strong>Try Demo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/extras/41a7461b729c463f19cd2050f733eaeb.avif?t=1773469469\" width=1560 height=220 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683780?t=1773469469","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/11fc1c56056791d9261752f2c2fed0a1936cc26d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773469469","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/6b8f81ad63c34c234a790fd7ff3f0242e167742f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773469469","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/6b8f81ad63c34c234a790fd7ff3f0242e167742f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773469469","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3978860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/extras/99a08527855383ed9f011c7dafa02799.avif?t=1773469469\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/extras/8ce4580789136fefcfa86e9e143a0c73.poster.avif?t=1773469469\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683780/extras/8ce4580789136fefcfa86e9e143a0c73.webm?t=1773469469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste